<body>
<header><h1>SignBridge</h1><div>Webcam prototype • Custom Gesture Set for SIH demonstration</div></header>
<div class="modebar"><button id="translationMode" class="mode active">Translation Mode</button><button id="learningMode" class="mode">Learning Mode</button></div>
<main>
<section class="card"><div class="wrap"><video id="video" autoplay playsinline></video><canvas id="canvas"></canvas></div>
<button id="start">Start Camera</button><div id="status" class="status">Camera not started.</div></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Recognized Sign</h2><div id="word" class="result">—</div>
<div id="conf">Confidence: —</div><br><button id="speak">Speak</button>
<h3>Prototype pipeline</h3><p class="note">Camera → MediaPipe hand landmarks → gesture classifier → text → browser speech.</p>
<p class="note"><b>Final SignBridge:</b> flex sensors + MPU6050 → ESP32 → trained ISL gesture model → text/speech and Learning Dashboard.</p>
<p class="note"><b>Prototype note:</b> We are using our own controlled gesture set for this demonstration. These gestures are <b>not official ISL signs</b>. In the next development stage, the same classifier pipeline will be replaced with verified ISL samples.</p>
<h3>Custom Demo Gesture Set</h3>
<div class="gesture-grid">
  <span>🙋 HELP</span><span>🤲 WATER</span><span>🙌 EMERGENCY</span><span>✋ STOP</span><span>👍 YES</span><span>👎 NO</span>
  <!-- DOCTOR: pointing up finger (Image 1) -->
  <span class="sign-card"><img id="doctorImg" src="" alt="Doctor hand sign"><b>DOCTOR</b></span>
  <!-- HELLO: open palm (Image 2) -->
  <span class="sign-card"><img id="helloImg" src="" alt="Hello hand sign"><b>HELLO</b></span>
  <span class="sign-card"><img src="data:image/webp;base64,UklGRpQxAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAMAAAA8wEAuQEA" alt="Thank you hand sign"><b>THANK YOU</b></span>
  <span class="sign-card"><img src="data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnwPAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAMAAAA8wEASgEA" alt="Food hand sign"><b>FOOD</b></span>
</div></section>
</main>
<section id="learningPanel" class="card learning" style="max-width:1050px;margin:20px auto;box-sizing:border-box;">
  <h2>🎓 Learning Mode</h2>
  <p class="note">Practice a target custom gesture. The prototype compares the live detected gesture with the selected target and gives immediate feedback.</p>
  <div class="learning-grid">
    <div>
      <label><b>Select target gesture:</b></label><br><br>
      <select id="targetGesture">
        <option>HELLO</option><option>HELP</option><option>WATER</option><option>EMERGENCY</option>
        <option>FOOD</option><option>DOCTOR</option><option>THANK YOU</option><option>STOP</option><option>YES</option><option>NO</option>
      </select>
      <div id="targetDisplay" class="target">👋 HELLO</div>
      <button id="practiceBtn">Start Practice</button>
      <div id="feedback" class="feedback">Select a gesture and press Start Practice.</div>
      <div class="scorebar"><div id="scoreFill" class="scorefill"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Learning Progress</h3>
      <div class="history">
        <div>Attempts: <b id="attempts">0</b></div>
        <div>Correct: <b id="correct">0</b></div>
        <div>Current Accuracy: <b id="accuracy">0%</b></div>
        <div>Last Detected: <b id="lastDetected">—</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
